        <p>ESTIMATES GIVEN FOR ALL CLASSES OF WOR</p>
        <p>PROGRAMMES 'FOR BAZAARS. PROGRAMMES FOR SALES OF WORK. PROGRAMMES FOR BALLS. PROGRAMMES FOR CON VERSAZIONES RGGRAMMES OR SOIREES. PROGRAMMES FOR CONCERTS. PROGRAMMES FOR FETES, &amp;C.</p>
        <p>PRINTING FOR BOARDS OF GUARDIANS, PRINTING FOR PUBLIC COMPANIES PRINTING FOR SCHOOL BOARDS, PRINTING FOR CHURCHES, PRINTING FOR CHAPELS,</p>
