        <p>£l6. One very superior Drawing-room Cabinet, in rosewood inlaid, sft wide 7ft 10in high, with drawer, cupboards,shelves, and four bevelled plates, £2l. Reduced to £l7 103. One superior Drawing-room Cabinet, in Chippendale mahogany, 41t 6in wide, 7ft high, with cupboards, shelves, drawers, and three bevelled plates, £l9 10s. Reduced to £l3 10s. Two Handsome Drawing-room Cabinets, in Chippendale mahogany. 41t. 6in. wide, 7ft. 3m, high, with cupboards • shelves, drawers, and seven bevelled plates, £l7 108. Reduced to £l3. Two Drawing-room Cabinets, in American walnut, 4ft, 6in. wide, 7ft. 7in. high, with drawer, cupboard, shelves, and 39 bevelled plates, £ll Iss. Reduced to £9 15s. Two Drawing-room Cabinets, in American walnut. 4ft. 61n. wide, 7ft. 41n. high, with drawer. cnpboard, shelves, and 39 bevelled plates. £ll 10s. Reduced to £9 10s. Two Drawing-room Cabinets, in rosewood, inlaid, 41t. wide, 7ft. high, with drawer, cupboard, shelves, and seven bevelled plates, £9 15s. Reduced to £B. Two Drawing-room Cabinets,in American walnut, 41t. wide, 6ft. 6in. high, with cupboard, shelves, drawer, and three bevelled plates, £7 10s. Reduced to £6 10s. 150 Drawing-room Cabinets, in walnut, rosewood, and Chippendale mahogany. from 39s 6d up to £35 10s. Similarly I reduced.</p>
        <p>ALL DRAWING-ROOM CABINETS REDUCED IN PRICE. ALL CHIFFONNIERES REDUCED IN PRICE. One very Handsome Overmantle, in Chippendale maho- gany, sft. wide, 51t. 6iu, high, beautifully carved and fitted with three shaped bevelled plates, £l3 19s. Reduced to 212. One very Massive Overmantel, in American walnut,slt. wide, stt. 61n. high, with carved panels, pillars, shelves, and six bevelled plates, £8 15s. Reduced to £7 10s. Two Very Superior Overmantels, in American walnut, 51t. 61n. wide, sft. 10in, high, with pillars, shelves, carved panels, and :0 bevelled plates, £7 10s, Reduced to £6. Two Overmantels, in American walnut, 51t. 61n. wide, sft. 10in, high, with pillars, shelves, carved panels, end 7 bevelled plates, £6 15s Reduced to £4 15s. One Overmantel, in American walnut, s:t wide, sft 2in high with carved panels, shelves, and nine bevelled plates, £6 10s. Reduced to £4 15s. Three Overmantles, in American walnut, 51t wide, sft lin high, with carved panels, shelves, and eight bevelled plates, £5 15s. Reduced to £4 58. One Overmantel, in American walnut, 4ft. 51n, wide, sft. 2in. high, with shelves, carved panels, and ten bevelled plates, £5 10s. ; reduced to £4 ss. Three Overmantels. in rosewood, inlaid, 41t. 81n. wide, 4ft. 31n. high, with pillars, shelves, and eight bevelled plates, £4 10a. ; reduced to £4. Three Overmantels, in rosewood, inlaid, 4ft. wide, 4:t. 6in. high. with pillars, shelves, and eight bevelled plates, £3 155.; reduced to £3 Is. Over 300 Overmantels. in bamboo walnut, Oak, mahogany. antique, Chippendale, and gilt frames, from Bs. 9.1. up to £l3 10s ; much reduced. All Overmantels Reduced In Price. Wood-frame Pier Glasses, with bevelled plates, in dark oak, walnut and mahogany. Usual price £8 10s. £7 10s, £6 10a, £5 55, 95a. 90s, 85s, 755. Reduced to £7 10s, £6 10s. £5 15s. £4 15s, 85s, 80s, 765, 675. and in proportion down to 275. 64. All Wood-frame Pier Glasses Reduced in Price. Over 50 Pier Glasses, in gilt, and enamel frames, with pl