      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1896-02-22_WidnesExaminer_art0085" n="art0085">
        <head>ONE ENJOYS</head>
        <p>ONE ENJOYS</p>
        <p>both the method and results whew the genuine and original SYRUP OF FIGS is taken; it is pleasant and refreshing to the taste, and acts gently yet promptly on the Kidneys, Liver, and Bowels, cleanses the system effec- tually, dispels colds, headaches and fevers, and cures habitual constipation. SYRUP OF FIGS is the only remedy of its, kind ever produced, pleasing to the taste and acceptable to the stomach, prompt in its action and truly bene- ficial in its effects; prepared only from the most healthy and agreeable sub- stances, its many excellent qualities. commend it to all and have made it the most popular remedy known. SYRUP OF FIGS is manufactured only by the</p>
