        <p>TAKING COLD. " Cold "is not necessarily the result of a high or ow temperature. A person may go from a hot bath directly into a cold one, or into snow even, and not take cold. He may remain out in the coldest atmosphere until chilled through, and still not take cold. On the contrary,he may take cold by pouring a couple of table- spoonfuls of water upon some parts of his dress, or by standing in a door, or before a stove, or by sitting near a window or other opening, where one part of the body is colder than another part. Let it be kept in mind that , uniformity of temperature over the whole body is the great thing to be looked after. It is the unequal heat upon ainefent parts of the body that produces Colds, by disturbing the uniform circulation of the blood, which in turn induces congestion of some part. Keep the feet always dry and warm, avoid draughts of air, keep the system braced up by plenty of sleep and good food, and by a powerful Tonic, and von will be proof against a Cold and its results. The very best Medicine, either for reventing or curing a Cold, is GWILYAI EVAN'S QUININE BITTERS, THE VEGETABLE TONIC, Which is the most perfect Vegetable Remedy known,and the most efficacious to strengthen the constitution, en- liven the drooping or deprested soirits,brace the Nerves, and remove all Disorders of the Stomach which are caused by Indigestion, such as Loss of Appetite. distress after Eating, Acidity of Stomach,Eructations, Heaviness and Langour. Disorders of the Liver are often caused by defective Digestion. The potency of the gastric juice in the process of Digestion is wonderfully aided by the powerful ingredients contained in GWILYM EVANS' QUININE BITTERS, THE VEGETABLE TONIC. While the Stomach recovers its normal tone, the putrid undigested food is cleared away, and the poor dyspeptic is relieved of his load of misery, once more enjoys good health, and looks forward to happiness and long life. GWILYII EVANS' QUININE BITTERS. THE VEGETABLE TONIC. Prices: Bottles, 2s. 9d., and 4s. 6d. each. To be had of all Chemists and Vendors of Patent Medicines in the Kingdom, or will be sent at above Prices direct from the Proprietors : QUININE BITTERS MANUFACTURING CO. LTD., LLANELLY, SOUTH WALES.</p>
